"Your e-readers are still set to sync your whole library, so marking this "
"shelf does nothing on its own. Switch your account to shelf-only syncing to "
"make it take effect."
msgstr ""
"Els lectors electrònics encara sincronitzen tota la biblioteca; per tant, "
